  "review": "<div class=\"my-6 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-sky-900 via-indigo-900 to-slate-900 text-white shadow-md flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-3\">\n  <div class=\"space-y-0.5 text-center sm:text-left\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center justify-center sm:justify-start gap-1.5 text-amber-300 font-extrabold text-xs\">\n      <span>❄️</span><span>2026年 冬〜年末年始旅行の予約速報</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-200\">\n      冬の味覚解禁（カニ・ふぐ・寒ブリ）や雪見露天・年末年始の宿泊枠は例年10月中旬〜11月上旬で満室が急増します。空室状況はお早めに確認を。\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D30109\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"shrink-0 px-4 py-2 bg-amber-500 hover:bg-amber-400 text-stone-950 font-black text-xs rounded-xl shadow transition transform hover:scale-105\">\n    👉 北海道 おすすめ名門ホテル・温泉旅館セレクションの自慢の温泉＆空室状況を見る →\n  </a>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b-2 border-amber-500 pb-2 mb-4\">【2026】北海道といえばコレ！海鮮丼・ジンギスカン・銘酒「北海道 おすすめ名門ホテル・温泉旅館セレクション」＆登別・定山渓おすすめ名宿比較</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-6 p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-50 via-emerald-50/40 to-stone-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-3xl shadow-sm space-y-3\">\n  <h3 class=\"text-base font-bold text-amber-950 flex items-center gap-2\">🦀 パウダースノーと海の幸の宝庫！大自然の絶景とジンギスカン・銘酒男山</h3>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed\">広大な北の大地・北海道。函館や小樽の海鮮丼、札幌の味噌ラーメンやスープカレー、香ばしいジンギスカン。旭川の雪解け水で醸す銘酒「北海道 おすすめ名門ホテル・温泉旅館セレクション」「北海道 おすすめ名門ホテル・温泉旅館セレクション」。地獄谷の湯煙が上がる登別温泉や札幌の奥座敷・定山渓温泉とともに贅沢な休日を満喫できます。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-stone-900 border-b border-amber-300 pb-2 my-6 flex items-center gap-2\">🏆 北海道を代表する最高峰名宿</h2>\n\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第1位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">登別温泉　第一滝本館</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.55</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/30109/30109.jpg\" alt=\"登別温泉　第一滝本館 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 地獄谷を望む1500坪の大浴場と5つの泉質巡り！豪華北海道ビュッフェ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">日本屈指の温泉天国・登別温泉の元祖。広大な大浴場で硫黄泉など5つの泉質を満喫。蟹やいくら、白老牛ビュッフェが大人気。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>ファミリー、三世代、北海道の名湯を満喫したい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>圧倒的な湯量と5つの異なる泉質なら迷わずここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D30109\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】登別温泉　第一滝本館 の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 rounded-3xl bg-white border border-amber-200/90 shadow-md hover:shadow-lg transition duration-300\">\n  <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-amber-100 pb-3 mb-4\">\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-amber-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-lg\">第2位</span>\n      <h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-stone-900\">定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ</h3>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"px-2.5 py-0.5 bg-amber-100 text-amber-800 font-extrabold text-xs rounded-full\">⭐ 4.12</span>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"mb-4\"><img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/20619/20619.jpg\" alt=\"定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ 外観・客室\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\" /></div>\n  <p class=\"text-xs font-bold text-amber-950 bg-amber-50 p-2.5 rounded-xl mb-3 border border-amber-100\">✨ 札幌駅から無料送迎バス運行！紅葉の渓谷美と5つの大浴場＆ビュッフェ</p>\n  <p class=\"text-xs text-stone-700 leading-relaxed my-2\">定山渓温泉の名門リゾート。露天風呂や、窯焼きピザ・ステーキバイキング、パン工房ラウンジが好評。</p>\n  \n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5 my-3 text-xs\">\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 rounded-xl border border-stone-200\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">👤 こんな旅におすすめ：</strong>カップル、ファミリー、車なしで北海道旅を楽しみたい人</div>\n    <div class=\"p-3 bg-emerald-50/60 rounded-xl border border-emerald-200\"><strong class=\"text-emerald-950\">🎯 選ぶ決め手：</strong>札幌駅直通シャトルバスと充実のバイキングならここ！</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"pt-3 text-center\">\n    <a href=\"https://hb.afl.rakuten.co.jp/hgc/54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583/?pc=https%3A%2F%2Fhb.afl.rakuten.co.jp%2Fhgc%2F54d2a438.4bc4abc2.54d2a439.aa1be583%2F%3Fpc%3Dhttps%253A%252F%252Fimg.travel.rakuten.co.jp%252Fimage%252Ftr%252Fapi%252Fkw%252FJBe8h%252F%253Ff_no%253D20619\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-block w-full md:w-auto px-8 py-3.5 bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 via-amber-600 to-orange-500 text-white font-black text-xs rounded-2xl shadow-md hover:scale-105 transition transform\">\n      ✈️ 【公式楽天トラベル】定山渓万世閣ホテルミリオーネ の最新空室・最安値プランを見る\n    </a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"my-8 p-6 md:p-8 rounded-3xl bg-white border-2 border-stone-200 shadow-md space-y-6 text-xs text-stone-800 leading-relaxed\">\n  <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between border-b border-stone-200 pb-4 gap-3\">\n    <div>\n      <span class=\"inline-block px-3 py-1 bg-red-600 text-white font-black text-[11px] rounded-full mb-1.5\">📡 楽天トラベル公式API 連携施設データ</span>\n      <h2 class=\"text-lg md:text-xl font-extrabold text-stone-900\">登別温泉　第一滝本館 施設スペック＆リアルタイム評価</h2>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n      <span class=\"px-3 py-1.5 bg-amber-50 border border-amber-300 text-amber-900 font-black text-xs rounded-xl\">⭐ 総合評価 4.56（口コミ 4,044件）</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-6 items-start\">\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-5 space-y-3\">\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/30109/30109.jpg\" alt=\"登別温泉　第一滝本館 外観・メインイメージ\" class=\"w-full h-52 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n      <img src=\"https://img.travel.rakuten.co.jp/share/HOTEL/30109/30109_kan1.jpg\" alt=\"登別温泉　第一滝本館 客室・館内イメージ\" class=\"w-full h-44 object-cover rounded-2xl border border-stone-200 shadow-2xs\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"md:col-span-7 space-y-3\">\n      <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-stone-200\">\n        <table class=\"w-full text-left border-collapse text-xs\">\n          <tbody class=\"divide-y divide-stone-200 bg-white\">\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900 w-32\">正式名称</th>\n              <td class=\"p-3 font-bold text-stone-900\">登別温泉　第一滝本館 （施設番号: 30109）</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n              <th class=\"p-3 bg-stone-50 font-bold text-stone-900\">所在地・住所</th>\n              <td class=